          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गढ़ना (gaṛhnā) is a tadbhava, inherited from gaṭhati, \"makes, forms\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 3966). CDIAL gives the Hindi verb as \"to form by hammering\"."
            }
